# Per-user topic ACL for the Mosquitto broker.
# Source: mosquitto.org/documentation/plugins/acl-file/
#
# Default-deny: an authenticated user with no matching "user" block below
# gets NO access at all. A bare "topic" line outside a "user" block would
# apply only to anonymous clients, and allow_anonymous is false in
# deploy/mosquitto.conf, so no such line is written here.

user poller
topic readwrite #

user wsreader
topic read lan/#
